\\ Round trip: the hand fixture bytes-index-bounds-suppresses-emit, in surface syntax.
\\ frontend/test.sh compares this program's run with the run of the fixture's artifact.

(define main {I64 --> I64}
  input -> (+ (bytes-index #x00 1) (later 1)))

